WEBVTT

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:04.183
which present no evidence
for ruling dynasties.

00:10:04.642 --> 00:10:09.605
And some of them also seem to have managed
perfectly well without priests,

00:10:09.647 --> 00:10:12.316
mandarins and warrior politicians.

00:10:12.858 --> 00:10:15.736
Of course, some early cities did go on

00:10:15.778 --> 00:10:19.156
to become the capitals
of kingdoms and empires.

00:10:19.657 --> 00:10:21.909
But it's important to note
that others went

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.912
in completely the opposite direction.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.499
To take one well-documented example,

00:10:28.499 --> 00:10:32.044
around the year 250 AD,